comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T15:40:48.463Z","harness:claude-code","Duplicate check at creation (2026-11-06): pm search \"local test suite fails differently from CI host environment harness\" returned pm-xgah3a (closed, a fixture recording provenance from the host harness), pm-631t9p (closed, harness-detection specs inheriting the ambient harness) and pm-t7wn04 (closed, a gate red locally from a telemetry warning). All three cover a spec that inherits host state. This item is the inverse: a fixture that needs an author it never pins, so it fails only when the host supplies none."
body: ""
